            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't know what's going on here with this.  I guess you added a serial daemon to phosphor-host-ipmi, but it will only be enabled with a PACKAGECONFIG.  As written, you're potentially going to mess up the existing ipmi providers?  Shouldn't we only have this set when a PACKAGECONFIG isn't `transport-null`?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "John Chung",
                        "email": "john.chung@arm.com",
                        "username": "gtossk2"
                    },
                    "message": "Acked. \n\nI have added a serial daemon to phosphor-host-ipmi, so it needs ipmi provider from phosphor-host-ipmi. Now only have this set when PACKAGECONFIG isn't `transport-null`"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 28,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "We need `transport-null` enabled by default, correct?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 28,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "John Chung",
                        "email": "john.chung@arm.com",
                        "username": "gtossk2"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 51,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "You need to add PACKAGECONFIG conflicts for these, if the intention is to only install one:\n\nhttps://docs.yoctoproject.org/dev/ref-manual/variables.html#term-PACKAGECONFIG"
                },
